WEBVTT

1
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:20,720
I rummaged through things and found this jade buckle. I thought it suited you, so I gave it to you.

2
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:24,850
No, keep the items you bring in by yourself.

3
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,109
listen to mother

4
00:00:26,109 --> 00:00:28,941
You haven't been out for a long time since you started business

5
00:00:28,941 --> 00:00:33,033
I made a special trip out of the gate just for that yard ball.

6
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:36,180
I thought you liked this?

7
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:41,910
After business, she really didn't go out. She just thought she would like it, so she went with her.

8
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:49,760
Since my husband said so, I must keep this jade button well.
